=== Editor Contrib - Move Lines Command > move first up / last down disabled #1
config: {"autoClosingPairs":[],"surroundingPairs":[],"brackets":[],"lineComment":null,"blockComment":null}
text: "first\nsecond line\nthird line\nfourth line\nfifth"
setSelections 1 1 1 1
cmd editor.action.moveLinesUpAction
expectText "first\nsecond line\nthird line\nfourth line\nfifth"
expectSel 1 1 1 1

